---
title: "Promtool download lifecycle"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Downloading
  s1: First download failed
  s2: Download group rejected
  s3: Waiting for downloads after cancellation request
  s4: All downloads settled after cancellation request
  s5: First download error reported
  s6: Both downloads succeeded
  s7: Both downloads returned
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Download fails
  s1 --> s2: Reject download group
  s2 --> s3: Request cancellation
  s3 --> s4: Download fails or Finish body read
  s2 --> s4: Request cancellation
  s4 --> s5: Report first error
  s0 --> s6: Finish both downloads
  s6 --> s7: Return both downloads
